  "historical_output_text": " Mention why you enjoy the hobby, any progress you've made, and what you hope to achieve in the future.\nHey there! Hope you're doing well. I wanted to chat about a fun hobby I've been really into lately - it's called embroidery. I've been so fascinated by the intricate designs and how each stitch can create something beautiful. It's like a puzzle where the solution is a finished piece of art. \n\nI've been working on a simple design of a sunflower that I found online. It's not as easy as it looks! But it's been so satisfying to see it come together stitch by stitch. I've already completed the center and the leaves. It's really helping me unwind and focus after a long day at work. \n\nI'm hoping to start a more complex design soon - maybe a unicorn or a peacock. I want to challenge",
